    STAFF -.x|FORBIDDEN: Database RPC Checks Role| I5
    STAFF -.x|FORBIDDEN: Database RPC Checks Role| I6
    ADMIN -.x|FORBIDDEN: Separation of Duties & Role Check| I6
    ANON -.x|REVOKED: No anonymous execution| I1
    ANON -.x|REVOKED: No anonymous execution| I2
    ANON -.x|REVOKED: No anonymous execution| I6
    ALL_ROLES["All Roles"] -.x|FORBIDDEN: Finalized Sheets are Read-Only| I3

    %% Role to Profile Connections
    STAFF --> P1
    ADMIN --> P1
